<title>USA: Mich. $72 mln hospital deal ylds 5.83 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Mich. $72 mln hospital deal ylds 5.83 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
